# Life Systems Program, Woodstock Country School: A Preliminary Curriculum Guide.

**Authors:** Hyman, Corinne B., Van Sickle, Janet

## Abstract
This curriculum guide presents documentation of development of a holistic approach to curricula in science, art, humanities, and environmental education for the secondary school level. The outgrowth of this curricula development was the integration of these disciplines into a "life systems" curriculum involving an interrelated teaching approach. The curriculum was implemented in a private school using a tri-mester program. Adaptation to public school schedules should not be difficult. (RE)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED180833

